 AND NEW MARKET GROWTH TEAM, AS MITEK INVESTS SIGNIFICANT RESOURCES IN TO DEVELOPING AND EVOLVING A MODULAR ENABLEMENT PLATFORM FOR DECADES TO COME."}{'symbol': 'BSX', 'date': '2021-05-19 03:00:00-04:56', 'title': 'Late-Breaking Registry Data at EuroPCR Congress Demonstrate Reduced Paravalvular Leak and Low Permanent Pacemaker Rates for the ACURATE neo2™ Aortic Valve System', 'text': 'MARLBOROUGH, MASS., MAY 18, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DATA PRESENTED AT HOTLINE AND LATE-BREAKING TRIAL SESSIONS TODAY AT THE EUROPCR 2021 CONGRESS DEMONSTRATED\xa0POSITIVE PROCEDURAL PERFORMANCE, INCLUDING LOW RATES OF PARAVALVULAR LEAKAGE (PVL) AND PERMANENT PACEMAKER IMPLEMENTATION (PPI), OF THE BOSTON SCIENTIFIC (NYSE: BSX) ACURATE\xa0NEO2™\xa0AORTIC VALVE SYSTEM\xa0WITHIN THE\xa0INVESTIGATOR-INITIATED EARLY NEO2 REGISTRY1 AND ITAL-NEO REGISTRY2 STUDIES.'}{'symbol': 'BMY', 'date': '2021-05-19 07:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Agenus and Bristol Myers Squibb Announce Exclusive Global License for Agenus' Anti-TIGIT Bispecific Antibody Program", 'text': "NEW YORK & LEXINGTON, MASS.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $BMY--AGENUS AND BRISTOL MYERS SQUIBB ANNOUNCE EXCLUSIVE GLOBAL LICENSE FOR AGENUS' ANTI-TIGIT BISPECIFIC ANTIBODY PROGRAM"}{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2021-05-19 18:31:00-04:56', 'title': 'Broadridge to Participate in the J.P. Morgan 49th Annual Global Technology, Media and Communications Conference', 'text': 'NEW YORK, MAY 18, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BROADRIDGE FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS, INC. (NYSE: BR) ANNOUNCED THAT TIM GOKEY, CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, WILL SPEAK AT THE J.P. MORGAN 49TH ANNUAL GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY, MEDIA AND COMMUNICATIONS CONFERENCE AT 3:40PM ON TUESDAY, MAY 25TH.'}{'symbol': 'CCL', 'date': '2021-05-19 15:00:00-04:56', 'title': 'Seabourn Sets Its Sights On The 2023 Season With Ultra-Luxury Voyages And Adventures In Alaska, The Pacific Coast, And Canada/New England', 'text': 'SEATTLE, MAY 19, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 SEABOURN , THE ULTRA-LUXURY CRUISE LINE, IS ALREADY LOOKING FORWARD TO SE