E NEWSWIRE) -- CSX CORP. (NASDAQ: CSX) PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER JAMES M. FOOTE WILL ADDRESS THE BERNSTEIN 37TH ANNUAL STRATEGIC DECISIONS CONFERENCE VIRTUALLY ON WEDNESDAY, JUNE 2 AT 9:00 A.M. EASTERN TIME.'}{'symbol': 'CVS', 'date': '2021-05-19 08:00:00-04:56', 'title': 'CVS Health Appoints Shawn Guertin Chief Financial Officer', 'text': 'WOONSOCKET, R.I., MAY 18, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CVS HEALTH (NYSE: CVS) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS APPOINTED SHAWN GUERTIN AS EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, EFFECTIVE MAY 28, 2021.'}{'symbol': 'DFS', 'date': '2021-05-19 07:00:00-04:56', 'title': 'Arab Financial Services and Discover Sign Network Alliance Agreement', 'text': 'MANAMA, KINGDOM OF BAHRAIN & RIVERWOODS, ILL.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ARAB FINANCIAL SERVICES AND DISCOVER SIGN NETWORK ALLIANCE AGREEMENT'}{'symbol': 'DTE', 'date': '2021-05-19 15:13:00-04:56', 'title': "DTE Energy Announces Private Offering of DT Midstream's Senior Notes", 'text': "DETROIT, MAY 19, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- DTE ENERGY COMPANY (“DTE ENERGY”) (NYSE: DTE) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT DT MIDSTREAM, INC. (“DT MIDSTREAM”), THE NEW INDEPENDENT, PUBLICLY TRADED COMPANY THAT IS EXPECTED TO BE FORMED THROUGH THE PLANNED SPIN-OFF OF DTE ENERGY'S NON-UTILITY NATURAL GAS PIPELINE, STORAGE AND GATHERING BUSINESS, INTENDS TO OFFER SENIOR NOTES (THE “NOTES”), SUBJECT TO MARKET CONDITIONS AND OTHER FACTORS.\xa0 THE NOTES WILL BE ISSUED BY DT MIDSTREAM AND GUARANTEED BY CERTAIN OF DT MIDSTREAM'S SUBSIDIARIES."}{'symbol': 'DTE', 'date': '2021-05-19 09:00:00-04:56', 'title': "Indigo Lavender Farms builds on sustainability practices with DTE Energy's MIGreenPower program", 'text': 'POPULAR AGRITOURISM DESTINATION IS FIRST FARM TO ENROLL IN THE PROGRAM POPULAR AGRITOURISM DESTINATION IS FIRST FARM TO ENROLL IN THE PROGRAM'}{'symbol': 'EMN', 'date': '2021-05-19 08:41:00-04:56', 'title': 'Eastman launches Fluid Genius™ to optimize heat transfer system performance with predictive analytics', 'text': '